      "writtenOn": "2025-10-24T18:10:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Likewise, we are not really using non-zero order allocations, so we can drop the `order` argument (i.e. keep it like it was in pKVM-ARM before aosp/3344127, and BTW like it currently is in the upstream pKVM-ARM code)?",
      "revId": "ee62f287569a29449ff811011b45661515146dbd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
