      "lineNbr": 823,
      "author": {
        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-27T13:51:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, thanks. (And this also makes me realize why this HYP_MEMCACHE_ACCOUNT_STAGE2 flag is useful, per my other comment.)\n\nRegarding the name, per my last comment in https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/3702535/8/arch/x86/include/asm/kvm_host.h#1112, how about just `mmu_teardown_mc`?",
      "parentUuid": "ea6fa4d2_ea41f8fa",
      "revId": "ee62f287569a29449ff811011b45661515146dbd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
