      "writtenOn": "2025-10-24T18:10:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. We should only do this if enable_pkvm is true?\n2. While we\u0027re at it, the above kvm_mmu_free_memory_cache() calls are unneeded with PV MMU, since we don\u0027t allocate those caches to begin with.\n\nSo, we could do the following at the beginning of this function?\n```\n\tif (enable_pkvm) {\n\t\tfree_pkvm_memcache(\u0026vcpu-\u003earch.stage2_mc);\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n```\n\n(BTW it would be nice to avoid the need for `#ifdef CONFIG_PKVM_INTEL`, if possible.)\n\nOr perhaps it\u0027s better to do this in kvm_mmu_destroy() before calling `free_mmu_pages(\u0026vcpu-\u003earch.root_mmu)` (since we don\u0027t allocate those pages either)...",
      "revId": "ee62f287569a29449ff811011b45661515146dbd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
